        "created_at": "2014-08-23T00:27:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>okay so, citizen dawn can summon her citizens with the return with the dawn card in her deck? this wouldn't count as being a scenario power, so im guessing she can. just want confirmation from you guys?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also, do the citizen she summon have the actions printed on their card and play directly after dawn? or are they treated more like unity's bots and dawn must use a action to control them?&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:21.391Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
