        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>okay so, citizen dawn can summon her citizens with the return with the dawn card in her deck? this wouldn&#39;t count as being a scenario power, so im guessing she can. just want confirmation from you guys?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also, do the citizen she summon have the actions printed on their card and play directly after dawn? or are they treated more like unity&#39;s bots and dawn must use a action to control them?&nbsp;</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
