      {
        "id": 116027,
        "name": "SeraAlexandria",
        "username": "SeraAlexandria",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-23T00:50:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>They play exactly as the cards say they play. They get their own turns immediately after hers. Of course, she can only ever have one out in a turn, and since you can't replace the card you pick up, would have to wait a turn after their incapacitation to replay them.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:48:21.579Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
