      {
        "id": 116028,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-23T01:06:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"SeraAlexandria\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/4491bb/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> SeraAlexandria:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>since you can't replace the card you pick up, would have to wait a turn after their incapacitation to replay them.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-s\">Actually, since Citizens have their own turn, this will allow them to stand up from Incapacitation on their turn, rather than having to take the card back and playing it at another time. However you would still need to do so if you want to switch Citizens.</span></p>\n<p>Ignore me!</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:48:21.661Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 11120,
        "topic_slug": "citizen-dawn-and-her-citizens-none-scenario",
        "display_username": "Ronway",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"SeraAlexandria\"]\n\nsince you can&#39;t replace the card you pick up, would have to wait a turn after their incapacitation to replay them.&nbsp;\n\n[/quote]\n\n[s]Actually, since Citizens have their own turn, this will allow them to stand up from Incapacitation on their turn, rather than having to take the card back and playing it at another time. However you would still need to do so if you want to switch Citizens.[/s]\n\nIgnore me!\n",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
        "staff": false,
        "user_id": 10,
